          "title": "Phone Data is Collected",
          "content": "Track your app usage and screen habits"
        },
        "block2": {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "title": "Sleep Data is Collected",
          "content": "Monitor your sleep, heart rate and movement patterns through your wearable device"
        },
        "block3": {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "title": "Answer Questionnaires",
          "content": "Recieve short daily questionnaires about your sleep and mood"
        },
        "block4": {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "title": "Take Cognitive Tests",
          "content": "Complete short Cognitron tasks to help us understand how sleep and smartphone use affect attention, memory, and thinking"
        },
        "block5": {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "title": "Analayse Patterns Overtime",
          "content": "Researchers will analyse the sleep data over several months to identify patterns and insights"
        }
      }
