          "blockType": "hero",
          "title": "Who Can Take Part",
          "subtitle": "No diagnosed medical condition is required — this is a general population study.<br />You can withdraw from the study at any time."
        },
        "block2": {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "content": "<div style='display:flex; gap: 1rem; flex-direction:column;'><div style='background-color: white; border-radius:48px; padding:2rem; display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;'><h3>Are 13 years or older</h3><img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RADAR-base/radar-self-enrolment-definitions/refs/heads/dev/projects/STAGING_PROJECT/resources/teenagerandadult.png' height='100rem'/></div><div style='background-color: white; border-radius:48px; padding:2rem; display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;'><h3>Regularly use a smartphone & Own a wearable device</h3><img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RADAR-base/radar-self-enrolment-definitions/refs/heads/dev/projects/STAGING_PROJECT/resources/devices.png' height='100rem'/></div><div style='background-color: white; border-radius:48px; padding:2rem; display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;'><h3>Install two secure research apps on your smartphone</h3><img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RADAR-base/radar-self-enrolment-definitions/refs/heads/dev/projects/STAGING_PROJECT/resources/radarApps.png' height='100rem'/></div><div style='background-color: white; border-radius:48px; padding:2rem; display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;'><h3>Wear your device regularly, including overnight</h3><img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RADAR-base/radar-self-enrolment-definitions/refs/heads/dev/projects/STAGING_PROJECT/resources/sleep.png' height='100rem'/></div><div style='background-color: white; border-radius:48px; padding:2rem; display:flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;'><h3>Answer Questionnaires & Cognitive Tests</h3><img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RADAR-base/radar-self-enrolment-definitions/refs/heads/dev/projects/STAGING_PROJECT/resources/regularlydevice.png' height='100rem'/></div></div>"
        }
      }
